2-weapon is hugely awesome for classes that can do it.  The Tsurugi
really _is_ junk; even 2 +7 longswords will do more damage than it by
a very wide margin (especially if your strength  is decent), and the
5% chance of instakill just isn't worth the difference usually.
Teleporting baddies might warrant using it while you're working your
way back to the stairs.

