MR is far more important than reflection, so I'll almost always opt
for GDSM with an early wish.  But you ideally want both, and if you
get,say, an early WoWishing then an MR artifact+SDSM is worth
considering.  You also have a 75% chance of finding reflection by
Medusa,  with no such chance of MR outside your quest artifact.

To  me the final decision comes down to how valuable the amulet slot
is compared to the cloak slot; I'd rather use "oReflection and be able
to wear a robe, but if you're not quite comfortable then "oLS is a
very nice safety net and SDSM/CoMagicResistance might be preferrable.
Ideally you want SDSM+an MR-granting artifact, then you can have both
slots free (I'll still usually go robe+ESP, but robe+"oLS is also
great).

If it's one of your first several tries at ascension, the "oLS is a
great help in dealing with situations you haven't seen before and well
worthwile.



